                else
                {
                    <p class="mb-1"><strong>Campaign / Journey:</strong> defines the action.</p>
                    <p class="mb-1"><strong>Consent controls:</strong> evaluate delivery eligibility.</p>
                    <p class="mb-1"><strong>SMS channel:</strong> moves communication into operator-gateway dispatch.</p>
                    <p class="mb-0"><strong>Delivery outcome:</strong> occurs after execution.</p>
